{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/965a8aa560cde1e6f894ddbf148b6cb8.avif?t=1758156403\" width=616 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a7d2504e5a904ac100ef4bd8f29c0592.avif?t=1758156403\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STARSPACE </strong>is proud to have pioneered the future of home computing by launching mobOS into orbit, the most powerful and comfortable computing experience for any kind of user. Whether you're new to computers or a total tech whiz, mobOS has everything you'll ever need for the rapidly growing online world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER - (06/27/2004)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>STARSPACE</strong>, we are aware more than anyone how current world events are affecting people's daily lives. We are wholly dedicated to ensuring an experience of comfort and familiarity as to make sure your transition to the online world is as smooth and easy as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a7d2504e5a904ac100ef4bd8f29c0592.avif?t=1758156403\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <strong>mobOS</strong>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>mobOS</strong> is a nonlinear operating system and internet exploration game set in 2005. Once you start playing, the clock in game is tied to your actual computer's time and date, updating in game pages, forums, software, updates, and more throughout real life time depending on how you interact with them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open ended and vast fictional internet full of forums, in-browser games, mysteries, downloadable software and music, desktop pets, viruses, and much more as it evolves and grows with you and your impact on it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Complete OS Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The primary environment for mobOS takes place on a faux-OS system that aims to be a complete, no corners cut experience. The operating system features a <strong>custom programming language</strong> and a <strong>custom scalable markup language </strong>for website and UI design. All applications that the game runs are written and compiled into executable files that the fake operating system is able to open and run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/0886580fe8a76b7c2408be70ba7c3417.poster.avif?t=1758156403\" width=1032 height=758 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/0886580fe8a76b7c2408be70ba7c3417.webm?t=1758156403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/0886580fe8a76b7c2408be70ba7c3417.mp4?t=1758156403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not Convinced?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hurt this guy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb317281fe35fcbd1d2.poster.avif?t=1758156403\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb317281fe35fcbd1d2.webm?t=1758156403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/fde80bbccb9a9cb3